{"id":"20260825T230437.712641527Z-cbba21c8","time":"2026-08-25T23:04:37.712641527Z","session_id":"session-20260825T224244.627431870Z","task_id":"task-1787697764627665115","source":"sensei","kind":"change.reported","summary":"Architectural change report\n  for: internal/gitx must be able to show a reviewer the WHOLE of a candidate's work, including files the worker created rather than only files it modified. Today a worker that added a file produced a diff that did not contain it, so the reviewer judged the candidate with its new files invisible.\n\nProvide the exported method:\n\n    func (r Repo) CandidateDiff(ctx context.Context) (string, error)\n\nIt must return a unified diff covering modified tracked files AND newly created untracked files, must honour .gitignore, and must return empty output with no error on a clean tree. How it does that is yours to decide.\n\n  files: 1 added, 2 modified, 0 deleted\n  go: 2 source, 1 test\n\n  governed by:\n    The human may stop computation at any time, but only an explicit authority decision can satisfy an authority boundary\n    A candidate is kept or removed by decision, and its evidence is recorded before anything is removed\n    The reviewer judges the whole candidate, including files the worker created\n\n  Sensei risk class: ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE\n\n  Sensei diff audit:\n    schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\n    decision: pass\n    availability: available\n    input_trust: caller_supplied\n    digest: 46274833def5c0e08161eb0397b3c555354919a61e987ee54bb5adab00ce434c\n    changed_files_count: 3\n    findings_count: 0\n    \n    No blocking findings found in supplied diff.\n\n  not established by this report:\n    - admission: not requested, so this candidate is not admitted\n    - correctness: reviewer acceptance is not proof, and passing tests are not proof","payload":{"files":[{"path":"internal/gitx/git.go","status":"modified"},{"path":"internal/gitx/git_test.go","status":"added"},{"path":"internal/workflow/engine.go","status":"modified"}],"audit":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 46274833def5c0e08161eb0397b3c555354919a61e987ee54bb5adab00ce434c\nchanged_files_count: 3\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","risk":"ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE","governing":["The human may stop computation at any time, but only an explicit authority decision can satisfy an authority boundary","A candidate is kept or removed by decision, and its evidence is recorded before anything is removed","The reviewer judges the whole candidate, including files the worker created"]}}
